      "text": "// only UserSerivce will have direct\n// acess to the User \n// this class also acts like a repo ,\n// we need to do this because of this time \n// constraint or elese a repository\n// would have been good\n \nUserService \n\nprivate:\n\n// {userId , User*}\numap < int , User*> users ;\numap < int , UserProfile*> profiles ;\npublic:\n\nvoidUpdateProfile(UserProfileDto dto , int userId) {\n    UserProfile *profile = profiles[userId] ;\n    if (dto.headline) {\n        profile.setHeadline(dto.headline);\n    }\n    ... similarly for other  feilds\n}\n\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "// only UserSerivce will have direct\n// acess to the User \n// this class also acts like a repo ,\n// we need to do this because of this time \n// constraint or elese a repository\n// would have been good\n \nUserService \n\nprivate:\n\n// {userId , User*}\numap < int , User*> users ;\numap < int , UserProfile*> profiles ;\npublic:\n\nvoidUpdateProfile(UserProfileDto dto , int userId) {\n    UserProfile *profile = profiles[userId] ;\n    if (dto.headline) {\n        profile.setHeadline(dto.headline);\n    }\n    ... similarly for other  feilds\n}\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
