      "originalText": "ConnectionService\n\n// maps the connection of a user to \n// other user\n// also acts on thm\n\nprivate:\numap < int , set < int >> connections ;\n\n\npublic:\n// basic logics here \nacceptConnetion(){}\nrejectConnection(){}\nbool areConnected (int user1 , int user2) {\n    return connections[user1].count(user2) ; \n}\n\n\n\n",
